00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
See environmental risks before they become disasters.

00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,600
251 real hazards. Right now. No mock data.

00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,200
Emergency teams have no data problem. They have a filtering problem.

00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:17,400
USGS, GDACS, Open-Meteo. Each speaks a different language.

00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:22,400
Different schemas. Different severity scales. Ninety seconds to decide.

00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:28,000
So we fetch all five sources server-side and normalize to one schema.

00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,200
Forty earthquakes. Two hundred fifteen disaster alerts. Live.

00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,200
Clustered at low zoom, individual severity at high zoom.

00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:43,200
Click any marker for source, time and severity.

00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:48,400
Filter to any region. The URL updates, so views are shareable.

00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:53,800
Now the part that makes this different.

00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:58,800
Ask it a region. It goes to the live web.

00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:04,200
Search, fetch markdown, classify severity, dispatch.

00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:09,800
Real network time. Not simulated progress.

00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:14,800
No API key ever reaches the browser.

00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:20,200
Everything lands in a triage log. Sortable and filterable.

00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:25,200
Searchable, and exportable straight to CSV.

00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:30,400
Four themes, including light and high-contrast accessibility modes.

00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:35,800
Applied before first paint, and persisted across reloads.

00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:40,800
React, TypeScript, Leaflet, Netlify Functions.

00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:46,200
Cached five minutes. When a source fails it serves stale data,

00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:51,400
with a badge. It never invents an alert.

00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:56,600
Sources that need a key say so. We are not faking numbers.

00:01:56,600 --> 00:02:01,600
Next: multilingual SOS triage and predictive dispatch.

00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:06,200
EcoPulse AI. Built with TinyFish.

00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,400
Live at ecopulseaiapp.netlify.app